  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>How to choose your sizeThis product is in Women’s sizing. Big Kids, select 1.5 sizes larger than your typical Big Kids’ shoe size.Ex. If you usually wear a Big Kids’ size 6, select a 7.5.Made from Sustainable MaterialsMade with about 20% recycled materials by weightSpeckled outsole uses Nike Grind—rubber containing around 13% recycled content.Product FeaturesSynthetic leather upper ages gracefully with time for a vintage aestheticLow-profile design for sleek stylePadded collar for additional comfortLightweight cushioned midsole provides supportive underfoot reliefPerforations at toebox for increased ventilationRubber outsole with classic hoops pivot circle provides reliable grip across surfacesLace closureThe Nike Dunk Low Next Nature is imported.A hardwood hero and streetwear superstar, these Women's Nike Dunk Low Next Nature Casual Shoes are making an eco-conscious comeback. Everlasting authenticity and planet-friendly design elements combine for this revamped classic. Crafted from a gracefully aging synthetic leather upper, these classic kicks are now made with around 20% recycled materials by weight and a Nike Grind rubber outsole—delivering old-school B-ball vibes that can't be outdone to this day.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low Next Nature Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td sty